   "date": "2024-08-15T18:48:11Z",
   "subject": "Calculating species mean shape",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone,<div>I have a shape dataset for 2504 individuals classified in one of 243 species. So each species has more than one individual and the number of individuals per species is unequal. Do you know how to calculate mean shapes for each species? I know this is more a general R question than a geomorph, but I believe someone had experience with this.<br></div><div>Mihajlo</div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "oR6P5faYAAAJ",
   "from": "Bruno Ferreto Fiorillo",
   "author": "b519bca0cf199020",
   "date": "2024-08-15T19:03:09Z",
   "subject": "Re: [geomorph-r-package] Calculating species mean shape",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Hi <span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\">Mihajlo,</span></font><div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">After performing your GPA using the &quot;bilat.symmetry&quot; or &quot;gpagen&quot; functions (be sure to provide a vector with species names), you can extract the results for each species as shown in the example below:  <br></font></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">list_sp1&lt;-GPA[,,species1]</font></span></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">list_sp2&lt;-GPA[,,species2]</span><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">  Next, you can calculate the mean shape using the &quot;mshape&quot; function:  <br></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">mshape(list_sp1)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">I hope this helps.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Bests,</font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(31,31,31);font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9.75pt;border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">--</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:21.3px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(68,68,68);direction:ltr\"><b><a href=\"https://brunoferreto0.wixsite.com/brunoffiorillo\" title=\"https://brunoferreto0.wixsite.com/brunoffiorillo\" style=\"border:0px;font:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://brunoferreto0.wixsite.com/brunoffiorillo&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483327407000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qpR4Q2jzw-Qq05Q4jj_Ft\">Bruno Ferreto Fiorillo</a></b></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:21.3px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(68,68,68);direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;fo