     1,
     "<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">Hi Mihajlo, <div><br></div><div>I am including a script for what you need to do:</div><div><br></div><div><div>Y1 &lt;- mshape(gdf_rio$coords[,,which(gdf_rio$Sp == &quot;Igeof&quot;)])</div><div><br></div><div>In this case, I calculated the mean shapes for the species “Igeof” … you can adapt this for your data, taking into account that <b>gdf_rio</b> was my data frame.</div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps,</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-al